msgid "Desktop Sharing"
msgstr "Rhannu Penbwrdd"

#: main.cpp:84
msgid "libvncserver"
msgstr "libvncserver"

#: main.cpp:86
msgid "TightVNC encoder"
msgstr "Amgodiwr TightVNC"

#: main.cpp:88
msgid "ZLib encoder"
msgstr "Amgodiwr ZLib"

#: main.cpp:90
msgid "original VNC encoders and protocol design"
msgstr "amgodwyr VNC gwreiddiol a dyluniad protocol"

#: main.cpp:93
msgid "X11 update scanner, original code base"
msgstr "Syllydd diweddariadau X11, cronfa gôd gwreiddiol"

#: main.cpp:96
msgid "Connection side image"
msgstr "Delwedd ochr cysylltiad"

#: main.cpp:99
msgid "KDesktop background deactivation"
msgstr "Datweithredoli cefndir KDesktop"

#: main.cpp:113
msgid "Cannot find KInetD. Have you restarted KDE after installation?"
msgstr "Methu canfod KInetD. A ydych wedi ailgychwyn KDE ar ôl sefydlu?"

#: main.cpp:115 main.cpp:122 rfbcontroller.cc:805
msgid "Desktop Sharing Error"
msgstr "Gwall Rhannu Penbwrdd"

#: main.cpp:120
msgid " Cannot find KInetD service for Desktop Sharing (KRfb). Have you restarted KDE after installation?"
msgstr "Methu canfod gwasanaeth KInetD ar gyfer Rhannu Penbwrdd (KRfb). A ydych wedi ailgychwyn KDE ar ôl sefydlu?"

#: trayicon.cpp:61
msgid "Desktop Sharing - connecting"
msgstr "Rhannu Bwrdd Gwaith - yn cysylltu"

#: trayicon.cpp:63
msgid "Manage &Invitations"
msgstr "Trefnu &Gwahoddiadau"

#: trayicon.cpp:70
msgid "Enable Remote Control"
msgstr "Galluogi Rheolaeth Pell"

#: trayicon.cpp:100
msgid "The remote user has been authenticated and is now connected."
msgstr "Dilyswyd y defnyddiwr pell ac mae'n gysylltiedig nawr."

#: trayicon.cpp:103
#, c-format
msgid "Desktop Sharing - connected with %1"
msgstr "Rhannu Bwrdd Gwaith - Cysylltwyd gyda %1"

#: trayicon.cpp:110
msgid "Desktop Sharing - disconnected"
msgstr "Rhannu Bwrdd Gwaith - datgysylltwyd"

#: trayicon.cpp:113
msgid "The remote user has closed the connection."
msgstr "Ceuodd y defnyddiwr pell y cysylltiad."

#: configuration.cc:374
msgid "&Manage Invitations (%1)..."
msgstr "&Trefnu Gwahoddiadau (%1)..."

#: configuration.cc:402
msgid ""
" When sending an invitation by email, note that everybody who reads this email will be able to connect to your computer for one hour, or until the first successful connection took place, whatever comes first. \n"
" You should either encrypt the email or at least send it only in a secure network, but not over the Internet.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pan yn anfon gwahoddiad drwy ebost, noder gall bob un a ddarllena'r ebost hwn gysylltu â'ch cyfrifiadur am un awr, neu nes i'r cysylltiad llwyddiannus cyntaf ddigwydd, pa un bynnag ddaw gyntaf.\n"
" Dylech naill ai gêl-ysgrifo'r ebost neu o leiaf ei anfon mewn rhwydwaith diogel yn unig, ac nid dros y Rhyngrwyd.\n"

#: configuration.cc:407
msgid "Send Invitation via Email"
msgstr "Anfon Gwahoddiad trwy Ebost"

#: configuration.cc:420
msgid "Desktop Sharing (VNC) invitation"
msgstr "Gwahoddiad Rhannu Bwrdd Gwaith (VNC)"

#: configuration.cc:421
msgid ""
" You have been invited to a VNC session. If you have the KDE Remote Desktop Connection installed, just click on the link below.\n"
" \n"
" vnc://invitation:%1@%2:%3\n"
" \n"
" Otherwise you can use any VNC client with the following parameters:\n"
" \n"
" Host: %4:%5\n"
" Password: %6\n"
" \n"
" Alternatively you can click on the link below to start the VNC session\n"
" within your web browser.\n"
" \n"
" \thttp://%7:%8/\n"
" \n"
" For security reasons this invitation will expire at %9.\n"
msgstr ""
"Rydych wedi'ch gwahodd i sesiwn VNC. Os ose gennych Gysylltiad Penbwrdd Pell KDE wedi'i sefydlu, cliciwch ar y cyswllt isod.\n"
" \n"
" vnc://invitation:%1@%2:%3\n"
" \n"
" Fel arall gallwch ddefnyddio unrhyw ddibynnydd VNC â'r paramedrau canlynol:\n"
" \n"
" Gwesteiwr:%4:%5\n"
" Cyfrinair:%6\n"
" \n"
" Yn lle hynny gallwch glicio ar y cyswllt isod i ddechrau sesiwn VNC\n"
" o fewn eich porwr gwe.\n"
" \n"
" \thttp://%7.%8/\n"
" \n"
" Am resymau diogelwch daw'r gwahoddiad yma i ben am %9.\n"

#: rfbcontroller.cc:351
msgid "%1@%2 (shared desktop)"
msgstr "%1@%2 (Penbwrdd wedi'i Rannu)"

#: rfbcontroller.cc:483
#, c-format
msgid "User accepts connection from %1"
msgstr "Derbynna'r defnyddiwr gysylltiad o %1"

#: rfbcontroller.cc:496
#, c-format
msgid "User refuses connection from %1"
msgstr "Gwrthoda'r defnyddiwr gysylltiad o %1"

#: rfbcontroller.cc:544
#, c-format
msgid "Closed connection: %1."
msgstr "Ceuwyd y Cysylltiad: %1."

#: rfbcontroller.cc:671 rfbcontroller.cc:676
msgid "Failed login attempt from %1: wrong password"
msgstr "Cais mewngofnodi methedig o %1: cyfrinair anghywir"

#: rfbcontroller.cc:712
msgid "Connection refused from %1, already connected."
msgstr "Gwrthodwyd cysylltiad o %1, eisioes yn gysylltiedig."

#: rfbcontroller.cc:722
#, c-format
msgid "Accepted uninvited connection from %1"
msgstr "Derbynwyd cysylltiad anwahoddedig o %1"

#: rfbcontroller.cc:730
msgid "Received connection from %1, on hold (waiting for confirmation)"
msgstr "Derbynwyd cysylltiad o %1, wedi' ddal (yn aros am wiriad)"

#: rfbcontroller.cc:804
msgid " Your X11 Server does not support the required XTest extension version 2.2. Sharing your desktop is not possible."
msgstr "Did yw'ch Gweinydd X11 yn cynnal yr estyniad XTest angenrheidiol fersiwn 2.2. Nid yw rhannu'ch penbwrdd yn bosib."

